  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity strengthening for partners in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD will support partners in Bangladesh to strengthen their capacity in the areas of safeguarding and financial &amp; organisational skills.  Local consultants will be engaged to assess capacity, and then propose and implement a plan of action to ensure that CAFOD&apos;s key requirements are met in line with the POFP and PSP processes.    The two consultants are known to CAFOD and familiar with CAFOD&apos;s ways of working.  Their ability to communicate with the partner staff in Bangla is key to this strategy.  If the initial consultancies are successful, the programme will explore additional opportunities to provide a level of ongoing support to our mid capacity and smaller partners.</narrative>
  </description>
